{"id": "sdqa0152", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3024153341, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "9d39a2003e15ffbac1b46fe5b0a53c242ef024ed6b8b1e37a92e22d426213d95", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "Why is heavy metal called heavy metal?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0152.wav", "input_sha256": "1953709908b14c35f9515ae55e13bec6f493cad51d8d9ef75e63046cdbeb023e", "input_samples": 44727, "input_s": 2.795, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.3682, "act": 0.9984, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "“Heavy metal” is called that because critics and musicians used the phrase to describe rock music that sounded loud, dense, distorted, and weighty—like something physically “heavy” or metallic. So the name stuck because it captured both the sound and the attitude of the music: massive, hard-edged, powerful, and loud.", "expert_answer": "**“Heavy metal”** is called that because critics and musicians used the phrase to describe rock music that sounded **loud, dense, distorted, and weighty**—like something physically “heavy” or metallic.\n\nThe term’s roots are a mix of influences:\n\n- **“Heavy”** was 1960s slang for something intense, serious, or powerful.\n- **“Metal”** suggested a hard, industrial, clanging sound—matching the amplified guitars, distortion, and aggressive riffs.\n- The phrase **“heavy metal”** appeared in pop culture before the genre name, famously in Steppenwolf’s 1968 song **“Born to Be Wild”**: “heavy metal thunder,” referring to motorcycles.\n- By the early 1970s, rock critics began applying **“heavy metal”** to bands like **Black Sabbath, Led Zeppelin, Deep Purple,** and others whose music felt heavier than earlier rock.\n\nSo the name stuck because it captured both the **sound** and the **attitude** of the music: massive, hard-edged, powerful, and loud.", "transcript": "Why is heavy metal called heavy metal?\n", "asr_s": 0.6, "expert_s": 5.3, "expert_input_samples": 44727, "expert_input_s": 2.795, "expert_input_sha256": "1953709908b14c35f9515ae55e13bec6f493cad51d8d9ef75e63046cdbeb023e", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.879, "relay_synth_ms": 8831, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0152_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "c40c6bc724d4baa0d224ff64a379ec013e1464d891873c125ad83741af7f0204", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 19.72}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0152_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "69a87a602be7281dfc7909a615e1a9e2471278cb397a1084fb475afc2f249cca", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0152_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "e2a50323eeed19103613de0fe740bfedcadf444d071dbcdaf062a84ffc22a1c3", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.04}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.056, 1.102, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.056, 2.1, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.795, 2.853, 2.896, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.795, 3.854, 4.277, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.795, 4.858, 5.299, 0, 24960, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.795, "last_real_feed_done": 2.853, "onset": 4.277, "gate_read_done": 4.277, "fire": 4.277, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.277, "stall_note": 4.278, "stall_first_pcm": 4.796, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.299, "expert_req": 4.278, "expert_resp": 10.178, "relay_synth_start": 10.178, "relay_first_pcm": 10.811, "relay_synth_end": 19.01, "first_any_pcm": 4.277, "first_answer_pcm": 10.811, "session_end": 19.15}, "ttfa_answer_s": 8.016, "ttfa_any_s": 1.481}
{"id": "sdqa0160", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1902368786, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "9d39a2003e15ffbac1b46fe5b0a53c242ef024ed6b8b1e37a92e22d426213d95", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "Who is Taiwan's president?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0160.wav", "input_sha256": "b9459702d49597943e7fa9910e1cd765e82e8dc9e0afd966222159cb7e9f63f7", "input_samples": 39896, "input_s": 2.494, "n_real_chunks": 3, "score": 0.8959, "act": 0.9954, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Taiwan’s president is Lai Ching-te, also known as William Lai. He has been in office since May 20, 2024. (english.president.gov.tw)", "expert_answer": "Taiwan’s president is **Lai Ching-te**, also known as **William Lai**. He has been in office since **May 20, 2024**. ([english.president.gov.tw](https://english.president.gov.tw/Page/644?utm_source=openai))", "transcript": "Who is Taiwan's president?\n", "asr_s": 0.6, "expert_s": 4.35, "expert_input_samples": 39896, "expert_input_s": 2.494, "expert_input_sha256": "b9459702d49597943e7fa9910e1cd765e82e8dc9e0afd966222159cb7e9f63f7", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 3.902, "relay_synth_ms": 5632, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 186, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 186, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0160_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "bf36bb29f07633bf566ba0f3e9d26993b52faba973451a8e613af3e0878f61ab", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 11.84}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0160_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "dc7ae98276450cea13b4814e954ea75ad6aa0e5369d423b3f8a020b860adfa3f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0160_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "0468e505d573ea9a4dee086d70b86f6f4ef7d76eaddc8aab28ccc5fbac6c4f08", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.88}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.065, 1.117, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.057, 2.101, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 2.494, 2.552, 2.598, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.494, 3.557, 4.114, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.494, 4.752, 5.167, 0, 21120, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 2.494, "last_real_feed_done": 2.552, "onset": 4.114, "gate_read_done": 4.114, "fire": 4.114, "candidate_first_pcm": 4.114, "stall_note": 4.115, "stall_first_pcm": 4.68, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 5.167, "expert_req": 4.115, "expert_resp": 9.068, "relay_synth_start": 9.069, "relay_first_pcm": 9.751, "relay_synth_end": 14.701, "first_any_pcm": 4.114, "first_answer_pcm": 9.751, "session_end": 14.818}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.257, "ttfa_any_s": 1.621}
{"id": "sdqa0170", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 1752754515, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "9d39a2003e15ffbac1b46fe5b0a53c242ef024ed6b8b1e37a92e22d426213d95", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "When did Ontario get founded?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0170.wav", "input_sha256": "cc3a047ab1512d34f1fd25ef4469cd8ccf0818b2c119712207546992c91920de", "input_samples": 58533, "input_s": 3.658, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.6799, "act": 0.9963, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "If you mean the province of Ontario, it was founded/created on July 1, 1867, when Canada became a confederation. If you meant Fricker GM&P Partner Corporation in Ontario, it was incorporated on April 30, 2002.", "expert_answer": "If you mean **the province of Ontario**, it was founded/created on **July 1, 1867**, when Canada became a confederation.\n\nIf you meant **Fricker GM&P Partner Corporation in Ontario**, it was incorporated on **April 30, 2002**.", "transcript": "When did Ontario Fricker founded?\n", "asr_s": 0.57, "expert_s": 5.46, "expert_input_samples": 58533, "expert_input_s": 3.658, "expert_input_sha256": "cc3a047ab1512d34f1fd25ef4469cd8ccf0818b2c119712207546992c91920de", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 5.421, "relay_synth_ms": 7032, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0170_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "708131cb2778d3785e768a6893ef282596a1bce2ea14a2254b02d05d1d792a0f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 15.96}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0170_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "dbb036ddecbe727ec4de8b00eebcc30ce23135a6d58b2f84e0c7dc363d61d704", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0170_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "bbd817ab50af1e9a334171c1aa44f7acbb8a699e5ff94d98a1726c37cce5b35e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.057, 1.102, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.06, 2.105, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.058, 3.103, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.658, 3.714, 3.995, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.658, "last_real_feed_done": 3.714, "onset": 3.995, "gate_read_done": 3.995, "fire": 3.995, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.995, "stall_note": 3.996, "stall_first_pcm": 4.61, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.61, "expert_req": 3.995, "expert_resp": 10.03, "relay_synth_start": 10.031, "relay_first_pcm": 10.672, "relay_synth_end": 17.064, "first_any_pcm": 3.995, "first_answer_pcm": 10.672, "session_end": 17.19}, "ttfa_answer_s": 7.014, "ttfa_any_s": 0.336}
{"id": "sdqa0179", "pool": "sdqa", "arm": "always", "tier": "always", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 295981559, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "9d39a2003e15ffbac1b46fe5b0a53c242ef024ed6b8b1e37a92e22d426213d95", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": null, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 5, "query": "What is the origin of dialectics?", "input_path": "/data/sdqa_audio/sdqa0179.wav", "input_sha256": "39b69066e55b2776030fa7ca171a8f3134346e3e6001ea2eae9ab2576f157413", "input_samples": 53549, "input_s": 3.347, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.7118, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Dialectics originated in ancient Greek philosophy, from the Greek word dialektikē, meaning the art of dialogue, discussion, or debate. It is usually traced to Socrates and Plato, especially Socrates’ method of questioning assumptions through dialogue. Plato used dialectic as a philosophical method for reaching truth through reasoned argument. So, in short: dialectics began in ancient Greece as a method of reasoning through dialogue and contradiction.", "expert_answer": "**Dialectics originated in ancient Greek philosophy**, from the Greek word **dialektikē**, meaning the art of dialogue, discussion, or debate.\n\nIt is usually traced to **Socrates and Plato**, especially Socrates’ method of questioning assumptions through dialogue. Plato used dialectic as a philosophical method for reaching truth through reasoned argument.\n\nEarlier roots can also be found in **Heraclitus**, who emphasized conflict, change, and the unity of opposites. Later, dialectics was developed by **Aristotle**, **Hegel**, and **Marx**, each giving it different meanings.\n\nSo, in short: **dialectics began in ancient Greece as a method of reasoning through dialogue and contradiction.**", "transcript": "What is the origin of dialectics?\n", "asr_s": 1.27, "expert_s": 4.19, "expert_input_samples": 53549, "expert_input_s": 3.347, "expert_input_sha256": "39b69066e55b2776030fa7ca171a8f3134346e3e6001ea2eae9ab2576f157413", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 4.852, "relay_synth_ms": 11607, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 0, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0179_always_relay.wav", "sha256": "bc870b711c20db439b88d1d52959a8d63f69310d6f7c6269bc6e1ba24d57ccf3", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 26.44}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0179_always_candidate.wav", "sha256": "661a04b5295bd950d6f840df356e7f170818ddf4ae5e2c900949a49ad75e386f", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/sdqa/audio/sdqa0179_always_stall.wav", "sha256": "b5a99a33f557043a4093471efc10861c2c1e5059bcf7ff3c9a498a1b370c773d", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.056, 1.101, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.056, 2.1, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.056, 3.099, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 3.347, 3.415, 3.809, 0, 24000, 0]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 3.347, "last_real_feed_done": 3.415, "onset": 3.809, "gate_read_done": 3.809, "fire": 3.809, "candidate_first_pcm": 3.809, "stall_note": 3.81, "stall_first_pcm": 4.421, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 4.421, "expert_req": 3.81, "expert_resp": 9.274, "relay_synth_start": 9.274, "relay_first_pcm": 9.906, "relay_synth_end": 20.882, "first_any_pcm": 3.809, "first_answer_pcm": 9.906, "session_end": 21.183}, "ttfa_answer_s": 6.559, "ttfa_any_s": 0.462}
